  "title": "Simple Sweet Potatoes",
  "description": "Sweet potatoes get the savory treatment in this simple recipe that calls for avocado, onion, butter, salt, and pepper.",
  "authors": [
    "Cansas Bell"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T03:03:40-04:00",
